{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787603593987636001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"unmythical-uninspired-olm","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":5,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"17a53e5ce3eef59fa4ca9d3d08c0c9a78beff5f109091e6acc38944ab72f203c","event_uuid":"6a18d268-61bd-4b58-a14e-59016a444c85","position":{"commit_sha":"723fad6917adb7eea1bc2988db78b466fb21f8a5","position":"1787594486142668001-6a18d268-61bd-4b58-a14e-59016a444c85"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"2dede4f7f5b4f26dd9cf7ff304d0081d8085c4a42ec0f067d1a1a76883882b27","event_uuid":"b73ad17e-2ece-44bb-bb7a-a5a731f9df17","position":{"commit_sha":"6bd151fee661017be40ee51fb2e2d6ab30a6f9c6","position":"1787594683202493001-b73ad17e-2ece-44bb-bb7a-a5a731f9df17"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"b5249c7e249a68ca59559d4d5d9950e9f0ec96e8dc8fee917d52c62695bfcc94","event_uuid":"52683c1e-2615-48d3-b04a-2f03e26d301e","position":{"commit_sha":"e9ac16a156db6fcac448f0ab06c9707ebbf789db","position":"1787598340298510001-52683c1e-2615-48d3-b04a-2f03e26d301e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"62274d62d4acd9fbd705606833fc5e24a0fd2a2df1674bbe25bd891fbca5ae3d","event_uuid":"a4643ea9-c956-425d-b5f7-d876afe2cfc3","position":{"commit_sha":"c5e7fc11bbbbf9e1145a82e0ddc2be5bf6a299ce","position":"1787598592973241001-a4643ea9-c956-425d-b5f7-d876afe2cfc3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"d96cab9bca452c84d5ccbc889b95381a74738f51af443308e8a50843131c8234","event_uuid":"d284640f-46ae-4a9b-901c-dcde56b21458","position":{"commit_sha":"6789271ea05a2d60a0a12973f6ef24931f063c66","position":"1787600368809112001-d284640f-46ae-4a9b-901c-dcde56b21458"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787594486142668001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"b73ad17e-2ece-44bb-bb7a-a5a731f9df17","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"fd4a-4e91-f179-4932"},{"link_uuid":"a4643ea9-c956-425d-b5f7-d876afe2cfc3","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"9015-739e-e72c-4fe5"}],"description":"Wire the copilot, codex, and claude client configs to connect to the rebar MCP endpoint over remote\nHTTP with a `static` bearer PAT (ADR deft-evolutive-mosasaur; PATs from exuberant-blockish-avians).\nSingle concern: the three client-side config shapes + a basic read-tool smoke — the endpoint/edge is\nesok, the credentials are avians, live prod verification is jackal.\n\n## Approach + rationale (research-confirmed static bearer for all three)\nResearch confirmed all three clients support a static `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header for a\nremote HTTP MCP server and none require OAuth, so one auth shape covers all three:\n- **Copilot**: `~/.copilot/mcp-config.json` — the rebar server entry with the HTTPS `/mcp/` URL and a\n  `headers` map carrying `Authorization: Bearer <PAT>`.\n- **Codex**: `~/.codex/config.toml` — TOML server entry using `bearer_token_env_var` (or\n  `http_headers`/`env_http_headers`) so the PAT comes from the environment, not the committed file.\n- **Claude**: `.mcp.json` (`headers`) or `--header`. Document the gotcha: a static header takes\n  precedence and does NOT fall back to OAuth if rejected, so a wrong/expired PAT fails hard (not a\n  silent OAuth retry).\nEach references the gitignored credential from avians (env var / local file), never an inline secret.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Tier: **real client config load + a basic read-tool call** (test-design §3 \"external-service\n  mapping\" via a reachable staging endpoint or a local `rebar-mcp` HTTP instance). Oracles:\n  - Each of the three configs is accepted by its client and lists the `rebar` MCP server (assert via\n    each client's server-list command), against a reachable endpoint.\n  - Each client executes ONE basic read tool (e.g. a ticket `show`/`list`) successfully through the\n    HTTP transport with the bearer header (oracle: a real tool result, not just \"connected\").\n  - Contrast (§6): an absent/invalid bearer yields an auth failure surfaced to the client (401), not\n    a hang — confirming the header is actually on the request path.\n- [ ] No secret is committed (the PAT is sourced from the avians env var / gitignored file).\n\n## Compat / rollback\nAdditive client config; rollback = remove the three server entries. No server-side change.\n\nDepends on: cibophobic-holohedral-esok (reachable endpoint), exuberant-blockish-avians (PATs).\nBlocks: creased-childlike-jackal (live prod verification).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","9015-739e-e72c-4fe5"],["depends_on","fd4a-4e91-f179-4932"],["parent","jira-reb-3527"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"jira-reb-3527","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"14f5-ca81-b70d-4550","ticket_type":"task","title":"Wire copilot / codex / claude MCP client configs to the rebar MCP server","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6a18d268-61bd-4b58-a14e-59016a444c85","b73ad17e-2ece-44bb-bb7a-a5a731f9df17","52683c1e-2615-48d3-b04a-2f03e26d301e","a4643ea9-c956-425d-b5f7-d876afe2cfc3","d284640f-46ae-4a9b-901c-dcde56b21458"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787603593987636001,"uuid":"8e6ad2b2-9f56-4d7c-aa8f-5eeb980f5183"}